{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118039","id":3472799732,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7O_rf0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118039","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118039.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118039.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118039","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118039/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118039/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118039/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/99bedbcb289a38d25d324275f4dc2127603faf5f","number":118039,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Update reminder about valid section and property names to remove erroneous information","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"After a discussion with someone I discovered that the documentation of `ConfigFile` said that space were not supported while this does not seem true from my experience.\r\n\r\nFor example doing  :\r\n```\r\nvar config_file := ConfigFile.new()\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tconfig_file.set_value(\"test avec espace section\",\"test avec espace key\", \"n'importe quoi\")\r\n\tconfig_file.save(\"res://test.ini\")\r\n\tconfig_file.load(\"res://test.ini\")\r\n\tprint(config_file.get_sections())\r\n\tprint(config_file.get_section_keys(\"test avec espace section\"))\r\n```\r\nWould result in this two line being printed\r\n```\r\n[\"test avec espace section\"]\r\n[\"test avec espace key\"]\r\n```\r\nshowing that it is in fact supported. \r\n\r\nAnd the file saved would look like that :\r\n```\r\n[test avec espace section]\r\n\r\n\"test avec espace key\"=\"n'importe quoi\"\r\n```\r\nThe property name is quoted and section doesn't seem to have any problem about it at all.\r\nThis was tested on macos only and I assume there is no difference between platforms but wouldn't mind people double checking it is the case.\r\n\r\nAs I think people might be writing those file by hand I am adding a reminder to quote property name when they are not valid identifier.\r\nI'm wondering wether we should add an example of quoted property name in the format example.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16